rs in Japan.\n", "short_description": "The Australian Open VR app is your ticket to the best immersive and interactive experience from the Rod Laver Arena. Content available only for users in Japan.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "748208292787655", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568674_748208299454321_9199275796024111845_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RLmh5oG8WMMQ7kNvwFNgB97&_nc_oc=AdosnMYFWO90zy1YuKz_hhBsbDZ-vccVU5jyZpHuggctlg_dOGSClcSNbi9IVaHY76k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1MvOwxdXoPCKChRtStWpTAQ9MVtashqVVWOFXMfRCBXA&oe=69F88DB9"}, {"file_name": "Hero Cover.png", "id": "704643830420157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75230051_704643833753490_981048534016631306_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MXu1OGA2KnsQ7kNvwFXXKq8&_nc_oc=AdqD3wR-nyfk-XqG0Z-3j71KJMZGmYFbdHs4wVlBY84rrephHwB0jb0Sb8Efp98rXUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3IthWTEH6rpCkk50BAgNbNLxGYEGiukOKbV786dPzjSg&oe=69F8B889"}, {"file_name": "Square.png", "id": "483520132656129", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75666286_483520139322795_3526818540801169626_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fRBBln_NAiAQ7kNvwHvKs_U&_nc_oc=AdqWZmZcVyS9lYrMgSmWBm399vqPoPGvf83BafiljGkbvvHyIhMcJ5I8cs9MEfIPejM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af18et88MudM4UJfnPfXqfpYMiNg1gcz11EkBclVCT7pGA&oe=69F8BC6E"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "426648561976328", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75272208_426648565309661_6996016450691187172_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6IFIWJzzEYsQ7kNvwHi7nCj&_nc_oc=Adry_ZZVcJMw9YQLenJkmj-HIHU5m94MbS9rfBJM4P8jihLzsYpASiadmSgp9bRs0Ac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-s